    <string name="tutorial_title">How to play</string>
    <string name="tutorial_body">• Tap an empty tile to build a tower. Tap a tower to upgrade or sell it.\n\n• Press Start wave when you\'re ready. Enemies walk the road to your crystal core. Each one that gets through costs lives.\n\n• Your power: once every wave, press ⏪ Rewind to jump back 10 seconds. Purple ghosts replay what was about to happen, so you know exactly where to build.\n\n• Win maps to earn ◆ crystals and spend them on Research.</string>
